        <body>
            <div xml:id="d454">

                <pb facs="0793" n="723" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg723"/>

                <head>No. 455.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Phelps to Mr. Frelinghuysen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1883-10-23"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 23, 1883</date>. (Received
                        November 17.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 18.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose a copy of a
                    letter from Mr. Novoa, informing me of the signature of a treaty of peace and of
                    the evacuation of Lima, which took place this morning. Iglesias has arrived in
                    Lima this afternoon and is at the palace. Peruvian flags are out, but there is
                    no spirit and no enthusiasm.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>S. L. PHELPS.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d454-a1.xml" xpointer="d454-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
